OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AWhat the Meta settlement means for the
OL,4,AUK, and other questions after the deal
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt the moment, they will just apply to
OL,7,Fchildren in the US - but they could
OL,8,Fhave an impact on the rest of the
OL,9,Fworld.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/19
