OL,3,ABBC director-general says he was not
OL,4,Aaware of 'severity' of cuts needed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere are expected to be around 2,000
OL,7,Fjobs cut as part of the process.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
